SUMMARY:Deadline: FutureTense Awards\, 4th Edition "Oneiric": media art and
  digital art awards for artists aged 30 or under based in Asia (up to HKD 
 15\,000)
DESCRIPTION:FutureTense is a Hong Kong non-profit platform for art\, design
  and technology\, running since 2019. The 4th edition of its awards takes 
 the theme Oneiric (of dreams): an open call for works at the intersection 
 of mind\, machine and myth\, with threads including the Cybernetic Unconsc
 ious\, Organic Digital\, Kantian Threshold\, Archetypal Dreamscape and Fra
 gmented Self.\n\nOrganisation: FutureTense (Hong Kong)\nLocation: Hong Kon
 g. For artists based in Asia: Hong Kong\, Macau\, China\, Taiwan\, Mongoli
 a\, Japan\, Korea and South East Asia.\nAward: Media Art Award and Digital
  Art Award: up to HKD 15\,000 each for artwork production\, with honourabl
 e mentions of HKD 5\,000. Best Popularity Award: up to HKD 10\,000 for art
 work production. No entry fee stated.\nDuration: Judging February to April
  2027\; winners announced May 2027\; award ceremony and exhibition August 
 to September 2027\n\nMore: https://award.futuretense.hk/?utm_source=artifi
 cialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://award.futuretense.hk/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm
 _medium=referral
LOCATION:Hong Kong. For artists based in Asia: Hong Kong\, Macau\, China\, 
 Taiwan\, Mongolia\, Japan\, Korea and South East Asia.
